# phiOS — A2 egress whitelist (docs/phios-agente.md §5.1).
#
# One POSIX extended regex per line, matched against the destination host
# (FilterExtended On, FilterCaseSensitive Off). tinyproxy default-denies
# everything not matched here.
#
# RULE: this list grows ONLY by explicit addition, for a registry a project
# on this machine actually fetches from. Never "just in case", never a
# whole TLD, never a wildcard broader than one service's domains.
#
# The broker does NOT need a line here — A2 reaches it on a dedicated unix
# socket (net/broker-a2.sock), not through this proxy.

# --- always needed: loopback (the broker forwarder, health checks) ---
^127\.0\.0\.1$
^localhost$

# --- package registries: UNCOMMENT ONLY WHAT YOUR PROJECTS USE ---
# Go modules
#^proxy\.golang\.org$
#^sum\.golang\.org$
#^storage\.googleapis\.com$
# Rust / cargo
#^crates\.io$
#^static\.crates\.io$
#^index\.crates\.io$
# Node / npm
#^registry\.npmjs\.org$
# Python / pip
#^pypi\.org$
#^files\.pythonhosted\.org$
# git over https (source dependencies, submodules)
#^github\.com$
#^codeload\.github\.com$
#^objects\.githubusercontent\.com$
#^raw\.githubusercontent\.com$

# --- opencode's own runtime needs (if it fetches @ai-sdk/* at first run) ---
# See PROGRESS.md S-71 held item. Uncomment only if a first contained run
# shows opencode trying to reach one of these.
#^registry\.npmjs\.org$
#^opencode\.ai$
